# Access key for the contact form, which posts to Web3Forms.
#
# Get one free at https://web3forms.com — you give them the inbox you want
# messages delivered to, and the key is emailed back to you straight away.
# No account, no database, no server.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and paste your key in. Vite only exposes
# variables beginning with VITE_ to the browser, which this one needs to be.
VITE_W3F_KEY=
